@startuml 3.6.6 - Gantt Timeline Task View
title Sequence Diagram — 3.6.6 - Gantt Timeline Task View

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' === Participants ===
actor "Creator / Client / Manager" as creatorclientmanager
entity "TaskListResponse" as tasklistresponse
entity "TaskRepository" as taskrepository
control "TaskServiceImpl" as taskserviceimpl
boundary "TaskController" as taskcontroller
boundary "TaskListPage (UI)" as tasklistpageui

' === Flow ===
creatorclientmanager -> tasklistpageui: Select "Timeline / Gantt" tab (optional filter: campaignId)
tasklistpageui -> taskcontroller: Request tasks timeline view (campaignId)
taskcontroller -> taskserviceimpl: getTasksGanttTimeline(campaignId)
taskserviceimpl -> taskrepository: findTasksByCampaign(campaignId)
taskrepository --> taskserviceimpl: 5: return List<Task>
taskserviceimpl -> taskserviceimpl: calculateTaskProgressAndDependencies(tasks)
taskserviceimpl -> tasklistresponse: mapToGanttResponse(timelineItems)
tasklistresponse --> taskserviceimpl: return ganttData
taskserviceimpl --> taskcontroller: return ganttData
taskcontroller --> tasklistpageui: return 200 OK (Timeline bars, dependencies, milestone dates)
tasklistpageui --> creatorclientmanager: Render interactive horizontal Gantt chart bars & milestones

@enduml
